Meta.documentation:Number.floor
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Rounds each Number down to an integer.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Streaming operator: toward negative infinity (floor(1.5) is 1, floor(−1.5) is
Meta.documentation:−2).
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_Number_$all — each Number
Meta.documentation:@port out_Number — the rounded-down result
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:Number:-1.5>>Number.floor:>>Console:
Meta.documentation:---
Meta.documentation:-2
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@see Number.ceil Number.round
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status stable
Meta.documentation:

